WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.040
Welcome, everybody, to this
evening's conversation,

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.190
The Loss of Green,
Imaging Vegetal Worlds,

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:32.299
hosted by the MIT Wiesner
Student Art Gallery

00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:36.260
current artist and organized
by her, Nancy Valladares.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.210
My name is Sarah Hirzel.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.410
Hi, Nancy.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.297
I'm the coordinator
of the gallery.

00:00:41.297 --> 00:00:43.130
For anyone who has any
questions or interest

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.520
in the gallery in the
future, please let me know.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.370
We will put a link to
the gallery in the chat.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:53.060
Before Nancy introduces her
partners, Semine Long-Callesen

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:56.090
and Shireen Hamza, I
want to invite everyone

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:59.570
to submit questions for the Q&amp;A
