their conversation,

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:09.920
but later, there'll be a
chance in the Q&amp;A for everyone

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:10.730
to participate.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.670
And we really encourage you to
use the Raise Hand button, come

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:17.840
on screen, and we look forward
to a lively conversation.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.050
Without further ado, I'd
like to warmly welcome

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:24.710
Nancy Valladares, Semine
Long-Callesen, and Shireen

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:25.550
Hamza.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.040
Thank you so much, Sarah.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:33.440
Thank you, everyone,
